      "start_seconds": 1.21,
      "end_seconds": 6.41,
      "duration_seconds": 5.2,
      "text": "Hi, um, doctor, I hope I'm not disturbing you."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 11.21,
      "end_seconds": 16.2,
      "duration_seconds": 4.99,
      "text": "You're alright, take a a seat. What can I do for you?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "CAREGIVER",
      "start_seconds": 16.74,
      "end_seconds": 21.93,
      "duration_seconds": 5.19,
      "text": "Morning, doctor. I'll stay and fill in anything that's missed."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 22.59,
      "end_seconds": 25.87,
      "duration_seconds": 3.28,
      "text": "Please do. Extra information is always welcome."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "CAREGIVER",
      "start_seconds": 27.17,
      "end_seconds": 31.94,
      "duration_seconds": 4.77,
      "text": "He's been having swollen painful finger joints, doctor."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 32.79,
      "end_seconds": 35.71,
      "duration_seconds": 2.92,
      "text": "Has this been going on for long?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 37.35,
      "end_seconds": 39.64,
      "duration_seconds": 2.29,
      "text": "About... well, three weeks."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 40.05,
      "end_seconds": 42.55,
      "duration_seconds": 2.5,
      "text": "I follow. Anything that improves it?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 44.17,
      "end_seconds": 48.64,
      "duration_seconds": 4.47,
      "text": "I, I get some relief from warm water."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 48.84,
      "end_seconds": 53.58,
      "duration_seconds": 4.74,
      "text": "Okay, go on. How troublesome is it day to day?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 54.79,
      "end_seconds": 56.5,
      "duration_seconds": 1.71,
      "text": "It's mild, honestly."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 56.78,
      "end_seconds": 59.91,
      "duration_seconds": 3.13,
      "text": "I follow does anything else come with it?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 61.9,
      "end_seconds": 71.95,
      "duration_seconds": 10.05,
      "text": "when it starts I tend to get sore wrists as well. The sore wrists? That's been for three days"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 73.78,
      "end_seconds": 77.05,
      "duration_seconds": 3.27,
      "text": "any chest pain, fever or eye redness?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 77.57,
      "end_seconds": 80.85,
      "duration_seconds": 3.28,
      "text": "Erm, no, I'd have said so."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 82.35,
      "end_seconds": 84.46,
      "duration_seconds": 2.11,
      "text": "Have you had any rash?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 85.75,
      "end_seconds": 89.43,
      "duration_seconds": 3.68,
      "text": "um, I haven't noticed any rash"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 90.89,
      "end_seconds": 94.83,
      "duration_seconds": 3.94,
      "text": "On the cardiac side, anything I should know?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 96.09,
      "end_seconds": 99.46,
      "duration_seconds": 3.37,
      "text": "So, no, nothing with my heart."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 101.52,
      "end_seconds": 104.22,
      "duration_seconds": 2.7,
      "text": "Have you been to theatre before?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 107.22,
      "end_seconds": 112.61,
      "duration_seconds": 5.39,
      "text": "Just a meniscus repair on my knee, four years ago."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 128.22,
      "end_seconds": 131.13,
      "duration_seconds": 2.91,
      "text": "What's on your current medicine list?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "CAREGIVER",
      "start_seconds": 132.7,
      "end_seconds": 138.91,
      "duration_seconds": 6.21,
      "text": "He is on lansoprazole, before breakfast, I give it to him."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 140.34,
      "end_seconds": 142.36,
      "duration_seconds": 2.02,
      "text": "Do you know the dose?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "CAREGIVER",
      "start_seconds": 143.43,
      "end_seconds": 151.7,
      "duration_seconds": 8.27,
      "text": "It's 30 milligrams. He is on ibuprofen, 400 milligrams, when needed, I give it to him."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 152.63,
      "end_seconds": 155.35,
      "duration_seconds": 2.72,
      "text": "How long have you been on it?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "CAREGIVER",
      "start_seconds": 156.51,
      "end_seconds": 158.44,
      "duration_seconds": 1.93,
      "text": "for about a month"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 174.76,
      "end_seconds": 178.13,
      "duration_seconds": 3.37,
      "text": "A few questions about your lifestyle now."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 178.86,
      "end_seconds": 192.19,
      "duration_seconds": 13.33,
      "text": "I work in accounts at a hospital. I grab fast food at lunch most days. I do a yoga class on Thursdays."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 193.76,
      "end_seconds": 198.19,
      "duration_seconds": 4.43,
      "text": "are there any allergies I should be aware of?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 199.58,
      "end_seconds": 203.57,
      "duration_seconds": 3.99,
      "text": "I don't think I have any, no."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 204.57,
      "end_seconds": 207.35,
      "duration_seconds": 2.78,
      "text": "Do you have any long-term conditions?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 208.14,
      "end_seconds": 223.85,
      "duration_seconds": 15.71,
      "text": "I, I have acid reflux. I didn't want to to make a fuss, you know, you know. So, um, I have COPD, for about a year."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 229.51,
      "end_seconds": 238.67,
      "duration_seconds": 9.16,
      "text": "Right, so acid reflux and COPD are already on your record. We'll keep that in mind today. Let's start with the basic checks."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 250.61,
      "end_seconds": 253.08,
      "duration_seconds": 2.47,
      "text": "That's it, just a little longer..."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 272.75,
      "end_seconds": 286.36,
      "duration_seconds": 13.61,
      "text": "Okay: SpO2 99 percent on room air, weight 85 kilos. And height 152 centimetres, respiratory rate 14, BP is 124 over 71, pulse is 75 beats a minute."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 287.41,
      "end_seconds": 288.95,
      "duration_seconds": 1.54,
      "text": "Is that okay?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 289.86,
      "end_seconds": 293.65,
      "duration_seconds": 3.79,
      "text": "So, don't worry, we'll discuss it in a second."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 295.51,
      "end_seconds": 298.54,
      "duration_seconds": 3.03,
      "text": "let's move on to the the examination"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 299.66,
      "end_seconds": 301.99,
      "duration_seconds": 2.33,
      "text": "Hold that for a second."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0041",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 314.55,
      "end_seconds": 321.29,
      "duration_seconds": 6.74,
      "text": "the knuckles and wrists are swollen and warm, and the squeeze test is painful"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0042",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 326.17,
      "end_seconds": 327.86,
      "duration_seconds": 1.69,
      "text": "You can relax now."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0043",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 339.69,
      "end_seconds": 349.9,
      "duration_seconds": 10.21,
      "text": "from what you've told me and and what I found, this looks most like an inflammatory arthritis flare let's get blood tests, for inflammatory arthritis"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0044",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 350.83,
      "end_seconds": 352.59,
      "duration_seconds": 1.76,
      "text": "That makes sense."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0045",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 354.37,
      "end_seconds": 358.4,
      "duration_seconds": 4.03,
      "text": "Let's get X-rays of the hands, for inflammatory arthritis."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0046",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 360.06,
      "end_seconds": 361.52,
      "duration_seconds": 1.46,
      "text": "That makes sense."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0047",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 363.0,
      "end_seconds": 385.5,
      "duration_seconds": 22.5,
      "text": "I'd like you to take methotrexate, 10 milligrams, once a week, long term you take it by mouth that should help with inflammatory arthritis gentle hand exercises and warm water in the morning i'd like to see you again in four weeks so, I think we're done unless you have questions"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0048",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 387.44,
      "end_seconds": 390.04,
      "duration_seconds": 2.6,
      "text": "alright, thanks, take care"
    }
  ]
